msgid "System default"
msgstr "Sistemska privzeta vrednost"

msgid "Plugins and storage menu"
msgstr "Vtičniki in meni naprav za shranjevanje"

msgid "Plugin browser only"
msgstr "Samo brskalnik vtičnikov"

msgid "Simple Swap Manager"
msgstr "Simple Swap Manager"

msgid "Create and manage swap files"
msgstr "Ustvarjanje in upravljanje izmenjalnih datotek"

msgid "Hard disk"
msgstr "Trdi disk"

msgid "USB storage"
msgstr "USB-pomnilnik"

msgid "SD card"
msgstr "Kartica SD"

msgid "Internal flash"
msgstr "Notranji flash"

msgid "OK  Select     EXIT  Back"
msgstr "OK  Izberi     EXIT  Nazaj"

msgid "OK"
msgstr "OK"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Prekliči"

msgid ""
"The zram device could not be created. This kernel probably does not support "
"zram."
msgstr ""
"Naprave zram ni bilo mogoče ustvariti. To jedro verjetno ne podpira zram."

msgid "Please wait..."
msgstr "Počakajte ..."

msgid "Could not start command."
msgstr "Ukaza ni bilo mogoče zagnati."

#, python-format
msgid "%s of %s written"
msgstr "Zapisano %s od %s"

#, python-format
msgid "Error code %d"
msgstr "Koda napake %d"

msgid "Error"
msgstr "Napaka"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "Zapri"

msgid "Done"
msgstr "Končano"

msgid "Cancelled."
msgstr "Preklicano."

msgid "zram is loaded and ready to use."
msgstr "zram je naložen in pripravljen za uporabo."

msgid "zram is built into the kernel."
msgstr "zram je vgrajen v jedro."

msgid "zram is available as a kernel module and is loaded when needed."
msgstr "zram je na voljo kot modul jedra in se naloži po potrebi."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The kernel of this receiver (%s) was built without zram. A swap file on a "
"drive is the best solution here."
msgstr ""
"Jedro tega sprejemnika (%s) je zgrajeno brez zram. Izmenjalna datoteka na "
"pogonu je tu najboljša rešitev."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The kernel supports zram as a module, but the module is not installed "
"(kernel %s)."
msgstr "Jedro podpira zram kot modul, vendar modul ni nameščen (jedro %s)."

#, python-format
msgid "No zram support was found in the kernel (%s)."
msgstr "V jedru ni bilo najdene podpore za zram (%s)."

msgid "available"
msgstr "na voljo"

msgid "module missing"
msgstr "manjka modul"

msgid "not supported"
msgstr "ni podprto"

msgid "System information"
msgstr "Informacije o sistemu"

msgid "UP/DOWN  Details     EXIT  Back"
msgstr "GOR/DOL  Podrobnosti     EXIT  Nazaj"

msgid "Receiver"
msgstr "Sprejemnik"

msgid "Image"
msgstr "Slika sistema"

msgid "Kernel"
msgstr "Jedro"

msgid ""
"The kernel decides which memory features are available. It is part of the "
"image and cannot be changed by a plugin."
msgstr ""
"Jedro določa, katere pomnilniške funkcije so na voljo. Je del slike sistema "
"in ga vtičnik ne more spremeniti."

msgid "Python"
msgstr "Python"

msgid "RAM"
msgstr "RAM"

#, python-format
msgid "%d times"
msgstr "%d-krat"

#, python-format
msgid "last: %s, %s"
msgstr "nazadnje: %s, %s"

msgid "never"
msgstr "nikoli"

msgid "Out of memory"
msgstr "Pomanjkanje pomnilnika"

msgid ""
"How often RAM and swap were full and the kernel had to end a program "
"(counted since the plugin was installed). If it happens, a swap file - or a "
"bigger one - helps."
msgstr ""
"Kolikokrat sta bila RAM in izmenjava polna in je moralo jedro končati "
"program (od namestitve vtičnika). Če se to dogaja, pomaga izmenjalna "
"datoteka – ali večja."

msgid "Swap support"
msgstr "Podpora za izmenjavo"

msgid "yes"
msgstr "da"

msgid "no"
msgstr "ne"

msgid "Required for swap files, swap partitions and zram."
msgstr "Potrebno za izmenjalne datoteke, izmenjalne particije in zram."

msgid ""
"zram compresses swapped out memory inside the RAM (about 2-3:1) - no drive "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"zram stisne izmenjani pomnilnik neposredno v RAM-u (približno 2-3:1) - brez "
"pogona."

msgid "zram (compressed RAM)"
msgstr "zram (stisnjen RAM)"

msgid "zram algorithms"
msgstr "Algoritmi zram"

msgid "known after loading"
msgstr "znano po nalaganju"

msgid ""
"Compression algorithms offered by the kernel. lz4 is fastest, zstd "
"compresses best."
msgstr ""
"Algoritmi stiskanja, ki jih ponuja jedro. lz4 je najhitrejši, zstd najbolje "
"stisne."

#, python-format
msgid "active (%s)"
msgstr "aktivno (%s)"

msgid "available, inactive"
msgstr "na voljo, neaktivno"

msgid "zswap"
msgstr "zswap"

msgid ""
"zswap is a compressed cache in front of a swap file. It is only shown here "
"for information."
msgstr ""
"zswap je stisnjen predpomnilnik pred izmenjalno datoteko. Tu je prikazan le "
"informativno."

msgid "none (only internal flash)"
msgstr "nič (samo notranji pomnilnik flash)"

msgid "none"
msgstr "nič"

msgid "Drives for swap files"
msgstr "Pogoni za izmenjalne datoteke"

msgid ""
"Drives with a Linux file system (ext2/3/4, xfs, ...) that can hold a swap "
"file."
msgstr ""
"Pogoni z datotečnim sistemom Linux (ext2/3/4, xfs, ...), ki lahko vsebujejo "
"izmenjalno datoteko."

msgid "Kernel configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija jedra"

msgid ""
"/proc/config.gz lets the plugin see exactly which features the kernel was "
"built with."
msgstr ""
"/proc/config.gz omogoča vtičniku, da natančno vidi, s katerimi funkcijami je"
" bilo jedro zgrajeno."

msgid "Swappiness"
msgstr "Swappiness"

msgid "Page size"
msgstr "Velikost strani"

#, python-format
msgid "%d bytes"
msgstr "%d bajtov"

msgid "Simple Swap Manager settings"
msgstr "Nastavitve Simple Swap Manager"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "Shrani"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "Izklopljeno"

msgid "Swap file at startup"
msgstr "Izmenjalna datoteka ob zagonu"

msgid ""
"This swap file is activated automatically every time the receiver starts. "
"The plugin waits up to three minutes for the storage device to be mounted."
msgstr ""
"Ta izmenjalna datoteka se samodejno aktivira ob vsakem zagonu sprejemnika. "
"Vtičnik počaka do tri minute, da se naprava za shranjevanje priklopi."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"How eagerly the kernel moves memory to swap (0-100). Lower values keep data "
"in RAM longer; 10-30 is a good choice for receivers. Current value: %d"
msgstr ""
"Kako rado jedro premika pomnilnik v izmenjavo (0-100). Nižje vrednosti dlje "
"hranijo podatke v RAM-u; 10-30 je dobra izbira za sprejemnike. Trenutna "
"vrednost: %d"

msgid ""
"Lower values also mean fewer writes, which spares SD cards and USB sticks."
msgstr ""
"Nižje vrednosti pomenijo tudi manj pisanja, kar varuje kartice SD in USB-"
"ključke."

#, python-format
msgid "Automatic (%s)"
msgstr "Samodejno (%s)"

msgid "zram compression"
msgstr "Stiskanje zram"

msgid ""
"Compression algorithm for the compressed RAM swap. lz4 is fastest, zstd "
"compresses best but needs more CPU. A change takes effect the next time zram"
" is set up."
msgstr ""
"Algoritem stiskanja za stisnjeno izmenjavo v RAM-u. lz4 je najhitrejši, zstd"
" najbolje stisne, vendar porabi več procesorja. Sprememba velja ob naslednji"
" nastavitvi zram."

msgid "zram at startup"
msgstr "zram ob zagonu"

#, python-format
msgid "Set up the compressed RAM swap (%s) every time the receiver starts."
msgstr ""
"Nastavi stisnjeno izmenjavo v RAM-u (%s) ob vsakem zagonu sprejemnika."

msgid "On"
msgstr "Vklopljeno"

msgid "Show plugin in"
msgstr "Prikaži vtičnik v"

msgid ""
"Where Simple Swap Manager can be opened. A change takes effect after "
"restarting the GUI."
msgstr ""
"Kje je mogoče odpreti Simple Swap Manager. Sprememba velja po ponovnem "
"zagonu vmesnika."

msgid ""
"Shows what this receiver supports: kernel, zram, zswap and drives. Press OK "
"to open."
msgstr ""
"Prikaže, kaj podpira ta sprejemnik: jedro, zram, zswap in pogone. Za "
"odpiranje pritisnite OK."

msgid "Open"
msgstr "Odpri"

msgid "Uninstall plugin..."
msgstr "Odstrani vtičnik ..."

msgid ""
"Removes Simple Swap Manager from this receiver. You can choose whether the "
"swap space is kept or deleted."
msgstr ""
"Odstrani Simple Swap Manager s tega sprejemnika. Izberete lahko, ali se "
"izmenjalni prostor ohrani ali izbriše."

msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Odstrani"

msgid "Uninstall Simple Swap Manager"
msgstr "Odstrani Simple Swap Manager"

msgid "Simple Swap Manager will be removed from this receiver."
msgstr "Simple Swap Manager bo odstranjen s tega sprejemnika."

msgid "Compressed RAM (zram)"
msgstr "Stisnjen RAM (zram)"

msgid "Keep swap space"
msgstr "Ohrani izmenjalni prostor"

msgid "Stays active until the next restart, then it is no longer used"
msgstr ""
"Ostane aktiven do naslednjega ponovnega zagona, nato se ne uporablja več"

msgid "Delete swap space"
msgstr "Izbriši izmenjalni prostor"

msgid "Deactivate now and free the disk space"
msgstr "Izklopi zdaj in sprosti prostor na disku"

msgid "What should happen to the swap space?"
msgstr "Kaj naj se zgodi z izmenjalnim prostorom?"

msgid "Not enough free memory"
msgstr "Ni dovolj prostega pomnilnika"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%s are currently stored in this swap space, but there is not enough free RAM"
" to take it back. Close some plugins or restart the GUI first."
msgstr ""
"V tem izmenjalnem prostoru je trenutno shranjenih %s, vendar ni dovolj "
"prostega RAM-a, da bi jih vrnili. Najprej zaprite nekaj vtičnikov ali znova "
"zaženite vmesnik."

msgid "Moving data back to RAM..."
msgstr "Vračanje podatkov v RAM ..."

msgid "Deleting swap file..."
msgstr "Brisanje izmenjalne datoteke ..."

msgid "Removing plugin..."
msgstr "Odstranjevanje vtičnika ..."

msgid "Simple Swap Manager has been removed."
msgstr "Simple Swap Manager je bil odstranjen."

msgid "Swap"
msgstr "Izmenjava"

msgid "Total"
msgstr "Skupaj"

msgid "CPU"
msgstr "CPU"

msgid "Swap spaces"
msgstr "Izmenjalni prostori"

msgid ""
"No swap space found.\n"
"Press YELLOW to create a swap file."
msgstr ""
"Ni najdenega izmenjalnega prostora.\n"
"Za ustvarjanje izmenjalne datoteke pritisnite RUMENO."

msgid "OK  Options     MENU  Settings     INFO  System info     EXIT  Close"
msgstr "OK  Možnosti     MENU  Nastavitve     INFO  O sistemu     EXIT  Zapri"

msgid "Create"
msgstr "Ustvari"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Nastavitve"

