msgstr "Nastavljanje stisnjene izmenjave v RAM-u ..."

msgid "Swap activated"
msgstr "Izmenjava vklopljena"

msgid "Deactivate swap"
msgstr "Izklopi izmenjavo"

msgid "Swap deactivated"
msgstr "Izmenjava izklopljena"

msgid "The file is not a valid swap file."
msgstr "Datoteka ni veljavna izmenjalna datoteka."

msgid "Activating swap..."
msgstr "Vklapljanje izmenjave ..."

msgid "Delete swap file"
msgstr "Izbriši izmenjalno datoteko"

msgid "Swap file deleted"
msgstr "Izmenjalna datoteka izbrisana"

msgid "Delete swap file?"
msgstr "Izbrišem izmenjalno datoteko?"

#, python-format
msgid "%s (%s) will be deactivated and deleted."
msgstr "%s (%s) bo izklopljena in izbrisana."

msgid "Restart GUI?"
msgstr "Znova zaženem vmesnik?"

msgid ""
"The plugin is unloaded completely after restarting the GUI. Restart now?"
msgstr ""
"Vtičnik se v celoti odstrani iz pomnilnika šele po ponovnem zagonu vmesnika."
" Znova zaženem zdaj?"

msgid "Restart now"
msgstr "Znova zaženi zdaj"

msgid "Later"
msgstr "Pozneje"

msgid "No suitable storage"
msgstr "Ni ustrezne naprave"

msgid ""
"No storage device with a Linux file system (ext2/3/4, xfs, ...) was found.\n"
"Swap files cannot be created on FAT, exFAT, NTFS or network drives."
msgstr ""
"Ni bilo najdene naprave z datotečnim sistemom Linux (ext2/3/4, xfs, ...).\n"
"Izmenjalnih datotek ni mogoče ustvariti na FAT, exFAT, NTFS ali omrežnih pogonih."

msgid "No drive needed  ·  fastest  ·  uses a little CPU"
msgstr "Brez pogona  ·  najhitrejše  ·  malo obremeni procesor"

msgid "FASTEST"
msgstr "NAJHITREJŠE"

msgid "Not available on this receiver - press OK for details"
msgstr "Na tem sprejemniku ni na voljo - OK za podrobnosti"

msgid "NOT SUPPORTED"
msgstr "NI PODPRTO"

#, python-format
msgid "%s free"
msgstr "%s prosto"

msgid "NOT RECOMMENDED"
msgstr "NI PRIPOROČENO"

msgid "NOT IDEAL"
msgstr "NI IDEALNO"

msgid "RECOMMENDED"
msgstr "PRIPOROČENO"

msgid "FULL"
msgstr "POLNO"

msgid ""
"Where should the swap file be stored?\n"
"A hard disk or USB drive is best; internal flash wears out faster."
msgstr ""
"Kam shraniti izmenjalno datoteko?\n"
"Najboljša sta trdi disk ali USB-pogon; notranji flash se hitreje obrabi."

msgid ""
"Where should the swap space be created?\n"
"zram compresses memory inside the RAM; it can be combined with a swap file on a drive."
msgstr ""
"Kje ustvariti izmenjalni prostor?\n"
"zram stisne pomnilnik znotraj RAM-a; lahko ga kombinirate z izmenjalno datoteko na pogonu."

msgid "Create swap file  1/2"
msgstr "Ustvarjanje izmenjalne datoteke  1/2"

msgid "zram not supported"
msgstr "zram ni podprt"

msgid "Not enough space"
msgstr "Ni dovolj prostora"

#, python-format
msgid "There is not enough free space on %s."
msgstr "Na %s ni dovolj prostega prostora."

msgid "Use internal flash?"
msgstr "Uporabim notranji flash?"

msgid ""
"Swapping to the internal flash memory causes many write cycles and may "
"shorten its life. A USB drive or hard disk is recommended."
msgstr ""
"Izmenjava na notranjem pomnilniku flash povzroči veliko ciklov pisanja in mu"
" lahko skrajša življenjsko dobo. Priporočen je USB-pogon ali trdi disk."

msgid ""
"The internal flash is soldered in and cannot be replaced like an SD card or "
"USB drive - if it wears out, the receiver itself is affected."
msgstr ""
"Notranji flash je prispajkan in ga ni mogoče zamenjati kot kartice SD ali "
"USB-pogona – če se obrabi, je prizadet sam sprejemnik."

msgid "Use internal flash anyway"
msgstr "Vseeno uporabi flash"

msgid "Use SD card?"
msgstr "Uporabim kartico SD?"

msgid ""
"Swapping writes to the card again and again, so SD cards wear out faster. A USB drive or hard disk is recommended.\n"
"If you use the card: a low swappiness (10-20) keeps the writes to a minimum."
msgstr ""
"Izmenjava znova in znova piše na kartico, zato se kartice SD hitreje obrabijo. Priporočen je USB-pogon ali trdi disk.\n"
"Če uporabite kartico: nizka swappiness (10-20) zmanjša pisanje na minimum."

msgid "Use SD card anyway"
msgstr "Vseeno uporabi kartico SD"

msgid "Custom size..."
msgstr "Lastna velikost ..."

#, python-format
msgid "Enter a size between %d and %d MB"
msgstr "Vnesite velikost med %d in %d MB"

#, python-format
msgid "New size for %s (currently %s):"
msgstr "Nova velikost za %s (zdaj %s):"

#, python-format
msgid "RAM: %s  ·  available: %s"
msgstr "RAM: %s  ·  na voljo: %s"

msgid "Create swap file  2/2"
msgstr "Ustvarjanje izmenjalne datoteke  2/2"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Select the size of the swap file on %s.\n"
"RAM: %s  ·  free space: %s"
msgstr ""
"Izberite velikost izmenjalne datoteke na %s.\n"
"RAM: %s  ·  prosto: %s"

#, python-format
msgid "Swap file size in MB (%d-%d)"
msgstr "Velikost izmenjalne datoteke v MB (%d-%d)"

msgid "Invalid size"
msgstr "Neveljavna velikost"

#, python-format
msgid "Please enter a size between %d and %d MB."
msgstr "Vnesite velikost med %d in %d MB."

msgid "File exists"
msgstr "Datoteka obstaja"

#, python-format
msgid "%s already exists and is not a swap file. Please remove it first."
msgstr "%s že obstaja in ni izmenjalna datoteka. Najprej jo odstranite."

msgid ""
"The existing swap file is in use and there is not enough free RAM to replace"
" it."
msgstr ""
"Obstoječa izmenjalna datoteka je v uporabi in ni dovolj prostega RAM-a, da "
"bi jo zamenjali."

#, python-format
msgid "%s will be recreated with %s instead of %s."
msgstr "%s bo znova ustvarjena z %s namesto %s."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"A swap file of %s will be created at\n"
"%s\n"
"and activated at every startup."
msgstr ""
"Izmenjalna datoteka velikosti %s bo ustvarjena v\n"
"%s\n"
"in aktivirana ob vsakem zagonu."

#, python-format
msgid "The existing swap file (%s) will be replaced."
msgstr "Obstoječa izmenjalna datoteka (%s) bo zamenjana."

#, python-format
msgid "This takes about %d seconds."
msgstr "To traja približno %d sekund."

msgid "Create swap file?"
msgstr "Ustvarim izmenjalno datoteko?"

msgid "Create swap file"
msgstr "Ustvari izmenjalno datoteko"

msgid "Deactivating old swap file..."
msgstr "Izklapljanje stare izmenjalne datoteke ..."

msgid "Removing old swap file..."
msgstr "Odstranjevanje stare izmenjalne datoteke ..."

msgid "Writing swap file..."
msgstr "Zapisovanje izmenjalne datoteke ..."

msgid "Formatting swap file..."
msgstr "Formatiranje izmenjalne datoteke ..."

msgid "Size changed"
msgstr "Velikost spremenjena"

msgid "Swap file created and activated"
msgstr "Izmenjalna datoteka ustvarjena in vklopljena"

#, python-format
msgid "Swappiness set to %d"
msgstr "Swappiness nastavljen na %d"

msgid "Protect the SD card?"
msgstr "Varujem kartico SD?"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The swappiness is %d. With 10, the receiver swaps out less often and writes "
"less to the card."
msgstr ""
"Swappiness je %d. Z vrednostjo 10 sprejemnik redkeje uporablja izmenjavo in "
"manj piše na kartico."

msgid "Set swappiness to 10"
msgstr "Nastavi swappiness na 10"

#, python-format
msgid "Keep %d"
msgstr "Obdrži %d"

#, python-format
msgid "needs at most about %s RAM when full"
msgstr "ko je polna, porabi največ približno %s RAM-a"

msgid "Compressed RAM (zram)  2/2"
msgstr "Stisnjen RAM (zram)  2/2"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Select the size of the compressed swap (RAM: %s).\n"
"The memory is only used when data is actually swapped out; about half the RAM is a good value."
msgstr ""
"Izberite velikost stisnjene izmenjave (RAM: %s).\n"
"Pomnilnik se porabi le, ko se podatki res izmenjajo; približno polovica RAM-a je dobra vrednost."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"A compressed RAM swap of %s will be set up (algorithm: %s) and activated at "
"every startup."
msgstr ""
"Nastavljena bo stisnjena izmenjava v RAM-u velikosti %s (algoritem: %s), ki "
"se aktivira ob vsakem zagonu."

msgid "kernel default"
msgstr "privzeto v jedru"

msgid "It is used before swap files on drives."
msgstr "Uporablja se pred izmenjalnimi datotekami na pogonih."

#, python-format
msgid "The current zram swap (%s) will be replaced."
msgstr "Trenutna izmenjava zram (%s) bo zamenjana."

msgid "Set up zram?"
msgstr "Nastavim zram?"

msgid "Set up zram"
msgstr "Nastavi zram"

msgid "zram activated"
msgstr "zram vklopljen"

msgid "Remove zram"
msgstr "Odstrani zram"

msgid "zram removed"
msgstr "zram odstranjen"

msgid "Remove zram?"
msgstr "Odstranim zram?"

msgid ""
"The compressed RAM swap will be deactivated and will no longer be set up at "
"startup."
msgstr ""
"Stisnjena izmenjava v RAM-u bo izklopljena in se ob zagonu ne bo več "
"nastavljala."

msgid "Check for updates"
msgstr "Preveri posodobitve"

#, python-format
msgid "When the plugin is opened, it asks GitHub at most once a day whether a new version exists, and shows a hint at the top. Only your IP address is transmitted; nothing is installed automatically. Downloads: %s"
msgstr "Ob odprtju vtičnika ta največ enkrat na dan vpraša GitHub, ali obstaja nova različica, in na vrhu prikaže obvestilo. Prenese se samo naslov IP; nič se ne namesti samodejno. Prenosi: %s"

#, python-format
msgid "Update available: v%s"
msgstr "Na voljo je posodobitev: v%s"
